Upstream issue: not filed yet.
Email watch tidy-ups: #114 format-character redaction, redundant index, independent expiry deletes.
From 9149bcd5820acd5b537d6aad70dfbce3d0600fe2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SplitMind <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:48:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(email-watch): strip all format characters, drop redundant
 index, tidy sweep (#114)

#114: code redaction removes every Unicode format character (Cf) and U+034F
before matching. Migration 0021 drops the (connection_name) index that the
unique (connection_name, gmail_message_id) index already covers. The pending
and acknowledged expiry deletes fail independently, with one error log per
sweep. BindLimitedD1.batch applies the bind limit to each statement.
